Subject: Cantor Self Work Update Broker B1 CDrive Production Preparation Operator Decision Verification P0 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] ebc7f758-7d67-48f8-bea5-79afc2012bc9

& [Need]
  + the exact proposal is published but no mechanism verifies a future operator decision without trusting mutable prose or a digest alone
  + production-broker fixtures model an authorization pair but do not authenticate a live policy key or operator decision

& [SmallestChange]
  + verify one supplied policy one embedded exact proposal context and one signed authorize-or-reject envelope
  + retain fixture-only deterministic evidence and no broker projection

& [WhyNotMore]
  + key generation signing policy governance clock observation fresh host observation private permit and physical broker invocation require distinct authorities and would collapse safety boundaries if bundled

& [Decision]
  + form the provider-free cryptographic-correspondence verifier and keep all live authority unresolved
